coder v0.0.0-devel

USAGE:
  coder workspace-proxy ls [flags]

  List all workspace proxies

  Aliases: list

OPTIONS:
  -c, --column [id|name|display name|icon url|healthy|url|wildcard hostname|derp enabled|derp only|proxy status|proxy report|proxy checked at|created at|updated at|deleted|version] (default: name,url,proxy status)
          Columns to display in table output.

  -o, --output table|json|text (default: table)
          Output format.

———
Run `coder --help` for a list of global options.
